#: src/sa_vote/jstemplates/sa_vote/pages/home.html:5
msgid ""
"You can also explore this year's idea submission cycle. <a "
"href=\"https://participate.boston.gov/page/about\" target=\"_blank\" "
"rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Explore 2026 idea submissions.</a>"
